11
00:00:42,566 --> 00:00:45,841
This is where the magic of Diffusion happens.

12
00:00:45,941 --> 00:00:48,766
The Decoder acts as a digital sculptor.

13
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:52,520
Guided by the summary of the healthy channels and the

14
